<section class="section">

<h2>The Challenge</h2>

<p>
Most artificial intelligence systems process information through
a single computational pathway. While these systems achieve
extraordinary performance, they differ fundamentally from the
bilateral structure observed in biological intelligence.
</p>

<img
  src="/SVG-DBR-LOGO.png"
